        "version": "0.3.0",
        "publishedAt": "2026-05-24T09:03:10Z",
        "notes": "## 版本变更 / Changelog\n\n## ✨ Features\n\n- feat: sniff (#15) by @arnoldhao\n  - 新增功能\n  - 新增「嗅探」功能，用于识别网页中的可下载资源。\n  - 新增「新建下载」中的嗅探下载方式，支持通过嗅探方式下载部分网站资源。\n  - 新增「嗅探台」，支持对任意网站进行资源嗅探，并选择特定文件进行后续操作。\n  - 新增播放器均衡器，支持 22 个预设方案，也支持自定义均衡器配置。仅 macOS 支持。\n  - 新增播放器频谱可视化，支持封面与频谱两种类型，共 8 种可视化样式。仅 macOS 支持。\n  - 修复问题\n  - 修复当前歌曲为播放队列最后一首时，无法点击「下一首」的问题。\n  - 修复歌曲包含多位歌手时，点击歌手可能被错误识别为同一人的问题。\n  - 修复「已结束」页面预览视频时，最大化与全屏按钮行为异常的问题。\n  - 修复「已结束」页面任务时间显示不正确的问题。\n  - 优化更新\n  - 优化「已结束」页面头部按钮，现在支持全选操作。\n  - 更新配置页面标签，新增「均衡器」标签，并移除「宠物」标签。\n  - 优化侧边栏迷你播放器按钮，现在支持加载状态显示。\n  - 更新连接模块，现在支持持久化完整的浏览器 Profile。\n  - 框架升级\n  - Wails 3 升级至 Alpha 95。\n  - New Features\n  - Added the new Sniff feature for detecting downloadable resources from web pages.\n  - Added a Sniff download method when creating a new download task, supporting resource downloads from selected websites through sniffing.\n  - Added Sniff Desk, allowing you to sniff resources from any website and select specific files for follow-up actions.\n  - Added a player equalizer with 22 presets and support for custom equalizer settings. macOS only.\n  - Added player spectrum visualization, including cover-based and spectrum-based modes with 8 visualization styles in total. macOS only.\n  - Fixes\n  - Fixed an issue where the Next button could not be clicked when the current track was the last item in the queue.\n  - Fixed an issue where multiple artists in a track could be incorrectly recognized as the same artist when clicked.\n  - Fixed incorrect maximize and fullscreen button behavior when previewing videos on the Completed page.\n  - Fixed incorrect task time display on the Completed page.\n  - Improvements\n  - Improved the header actions on the Completed page. Select All is now supported.\n  - Updated the Settings page tabs by adding Equalizer and removing Pets.\n  - Improved the sidebar mini player buttons with loading state support.\n  - Updated the Connection module to support persistent full browser profiles.\n  - Framework\n  - Upgraded Wails 3 to Alpha 95.",
        "releasePage": "https://github.com/arnoldhao/xiadown/releases/tag/v0.3.0",
